cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this connector, please cite it as below."
title: "RemixViral MCP connector (Gemini CLI extension)"
type: software
abstract: "RemixViral is an AI clip maker built for AI agents to operate over MCP: the owner uploads a long video they own, the agent reads the ranked, captioned 9:16 Shorts cut from it and can start faceless Shorts, and the owner reviews and approves. This repository is the Gemini CLI extension that connects an agent to the remote server https://remixviral.ai/api/mcp (registry name ai.remixviral/clipper)."
authors:
  - name: "RemixViral"
    website: "https://remixviral.ai"
url: "https://remixviral.ai/en/mcp"
repository-code: "https://github.com/airdropfi/remixviral-gemini-extension"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - mcp
  - mcp-server
  - ai-agents
  - ai-clip-maker
  - youtube-shorts
